        "list": [
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: left = \"4\", right = \"1000\"\nOutput: 4\nExplanation: 4, 9, 121, and 484 are superpalindromes.\nNote that 676 is not a superpalindrome: 26 * 26 = 676, but 26 is not a palindrome.\n```"
            },
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: left = \"1\", right = \"2\"\nOutput: 1\n```"
            }
        ]
